            "tb-first-induction-proof"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-divisibility",
        "moduleId": "induction-in-action",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材例：整除性",
        "markdown": "**例**：设 $a,b$ 为相异整数，证明对任意正整数 $n$，$a^n-b^n$ 都是 $a-b$ 的倍数。\n\n- 基础：$n=1$ 时 $a^1-b^1=a-b$，当然是 $a-b$ 的倍数。\n- 归纳步骤：假设 $a^k-b^k$ 是 $a-b$ 的倍数，记 $a^k-b^k=(a-b)m$。利用\n\n$$a^{k+1}-b^{k+1}=a(a^k-b^k)+(a-b)b^k,$$\n\n代入假设得 $a^{k+1}-b^{k+1}=(a-b)(am+b^k)$，故仍为 $a-b$ 的倍数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000009"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Methods of Proof",
                "Mathematical Induction"
              ],
