      {
        "id": "model-shift-start",
        "moduleId": "extended-strong",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "扩展形式的作用",
        "markdown": "扩展形式解决的是“命题从 $n=m$ 才开始成立”的情况。用法上只需把起点换成 $m$，其余规则不变；它并没有加强归纳步骤本身，只是允许平移起点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-extended"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-extended-example",
        "moduleId": "extended-strong",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材例：n≥5 时 2^n>n^2",
        "markdown": "**例**：证明当 $n \\ge 5$ 时，$2^n>n^2$。取 $m=5$。基础：$2^5=32>25=5^2$。假设 $k \\ge 5$ 且 $2^k>k^2$，则\n\n$$2^{k+1}=2\\cdot 2^k>2k^2.$$\n\n又 $(k+1)^2=k^2+2k+1$，而 $k \\ge 5$ 时 $k^2-2k=k(k-2)>1$，即 $2k^2>k^2+2k+1$，于是 $2^{k+1}>(k+1)^2$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000009"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
